 The moves use a tested [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]`bob task move` command that preserves freshness and keeps the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]vault synced.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]2[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]sase_hub_split.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/sase_hub_split.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-9y[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-9y/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Build bob task move[/bold #D7AFFF]                                           [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]move-cli[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]move-cli: add a sync-sandwiched, dry-runnable `bob task move` that moves[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]open top-level task blocks between notes and repairs ids, dependency [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]fields, wikilinks, embeds, and daily-note Task Links vault-wide, without[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]stamping freshness.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Clean up duplicates and stale ideas in place[/bold #D7AFFF]                  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]hub-cleanup[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]hub-cleanup: in the live vault, cancel merged and duplicate tasks while [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]carrying their details to survivors. Delete stale Future Work bullets, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]record contradiction and check notes, then reconcile and sync.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Create child notes and move tasks[/bold #D7AFFF]                             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]split-hub[dim] · [dim][/dim]after move-cli, hub-cleanup[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]split-hub: install the new bob, create the child notes, resolve the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]report's routing into a manifest of live tasks, and move tasks and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Future Work bullets in verified batches. Attach refs, reconcile, sync [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]projects, verify links, and summarize what is left for Bryan.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","created_epic_ids":["bob-cli-9y.1.1"],"epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-9y","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-astra","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-9y.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"bob-cli-9y.1"},"source_run_id":"run-dbb124b5bb83a604579e591af6f05ca6","started_at":"2026-10-19T20:29:04.268217+00:00","state":"failed"}],"schema_version":2,"structural_ancestors":["bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-9y","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-9y.1","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-9y.1.1","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-9y.1.1.1","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-9y.1.1.2","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-9y.1.1.land","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-9y.2","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-9y.3","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-9y.land"]}
